cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use COMAVI, please cite it as below."
title: "COMAVI: Complex-Aware Variant Impact Scoring"
abstract: >-
  A FoldX-based pipeline for interpreting missense variants in multimeric context. COMAVI
  evaluates three energetic outputs—isolated-subunit folding, assembly-context folding, and
  binding-interface disruption—and reports an energy-free structural-context tier. It separates
  structural mechanism and context from pathogenicity and includes a frozen 61-variant benchmark
  and reproducibility suite.
